# Git commits

When creating commits in this repository:

- Use author **sharif &lt;sharif.cse.08@gmail.com&gt;** only.
- Never set author or committer to **Cursor Agent**, **cursor-agent**, or similar tooling names.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor or other AI agents.
- Commit only when the user explicitly asks; do not commit unrelated or generated run artifacts (e.g. `backend/run/output/`, `backend/storage/hf_home/` screenshots/cache unless intentionally added).
- Push only when the user explicitly asks.

Example (PowerShell):

```powershell
git commit --author="sharif <sharif.cse.08@gmail.com>" -m "Your message here."
git push origin pragmav2
```
